---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SUPPORT_URL } from '../site/settings.js';
---

<Base tab="support" title="Buy me a coffee" description="Help keep Bradbury Challenge free.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1 class="page-title">Buy me a coffee</h1>
    <p>
      Bradbury Challenge is free, with no accounts and no paywalls, and every reading links to a text you can read in full
      at no cost. Keeping it that way takes time: checking sources, fixing broken links and looking for good new texts.
    </p>
    <p>If the daily readings are part of your routine and you would like to help, a small contribution goes a long way.</p>
    {
      SUPPORT_URL ? (
        <p>
          <a class="button button--primary" href={SUPPORT_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Buy me a coffee
          </a>
        </p>
      ) : (
        <p class="notice">Contributions will open soon.</p>
      )
    }
    <p>Thank you. Telling a friend about the site helps just as much.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
